Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(tui):=20abort=20=E5=AE=8C=E5=85=A8=E9=9D=99?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=9F=B3=E5=B9=B6=E4=BB=8E=E6=BA=90=E5=A4=B4=E4=BF=AE=E5=A4=8D?=
